  "created_date": "2026-08-10",
  "claim_scope": "GlobalSettlementABI V1 commits one exact public route-assumption root per opaque route witness and one canonical command-aggregation journal per fanout group. A pinned RISC0 3.0.6 closed guest resolves one through eight direct route claims or canonical fanout-8 same-image command groups for nine through sixty-four commands before committing the exact epoch certificate journal.",
