  ],
  "failure_modes": [
    "the epoch certificate omits or substitutes the exact child image-and-journal assumption root",
    "RISC0 image words use an implicit or inconsistent byte order across host, guest, and ABI roots",
    "a missing, extra, reordered, wrong-image, or noncanonical child claim reaches env::verify",
    "a Fake, Composite, Groth16, empty, wrong-journal, or unverifiable child receipt is installed as a direct assumption",
    "zero or more than eight direct children or command-group children enter their corresponding guest branch",
    "eight or fewer, more than sixty-four, reordered, overlapping, gapped, or noncanonical command groups enter the aggregated epoch branch",
    "a command group verifies under a foreign image or carries a substituted route slice, state boundary, or module-leaf total",
    "the root receipt is non-Succinct, has a foreign journal, or verifies under another image",
    "the quarantined structural test leaf is relabeled as an economic route proof",
    "typed 64-command BVA is relabeled as a completed 73-receipt real replay, throughput benchmark, or production authority"
