    "reason": "Python and Rust tests arrange typed profiles, occurrences, canonical route journals, assumption roots, command groups, child receipts, and verifier boundaries; act through one journal construction, admission, preflight, host assembly, or proof call; and assert exact roots, group positions, module-leaf totals, receipt kinds, journals, errors, and no authority on rejection."
  },
  "reject_is_noop": {
    "status": "applied",
    "reason": "Pure direct, command-group, and aggregated-root preflight plus host admission return typed errors before assumption installation for cardinality, grouping, sequencing, module-leaf, image, journal, and receipt-kind defects. Python commit regressions separately assert unchanged state for foreign certificate and binding rejection."
  },
